like encounter groups, therapy, dancing naked around a burning pyre,
etc. all have a common thread.

That thread is stimulation of neuo-chemicals and other aspects of
our neuo-system. It is easy to dismiss feelings as just emotions,
but emotions are real.

Today we have to say if someone is depressed (clinically speaking):
	* Talk about your early childhood
	* Express un-expressed anger at your parents
	* etc.

All these activities will release/stimulate/manipulate the brain, in a
very rough crude way. (But statistical evidence indicates that these
methods work).

Such methods lag well behind the hard sciences were theories are/have
been developed that are far more predictive.

In some distant future, it may be possible to cure clinical depression
using some treatment of neuro-chemicals. (Not like today's methods
of drug treatments which seem to more "mask" problems than cure them.

